p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<div><div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>From:</b> Alex Example &lt;alex@yourcompany.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, November 4, 2026 9:02 AM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Pat Staffer &lt;pat@yourcompany.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> FW: Follow up - Northgate<o:p></o:p></p></div></div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Pat - this is the family office I met at the conference. They'd like a call next week, can you take it?<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1F3864\">Alex Example</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Associate | Your Company<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Mobile (555) 010-0102<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">alex@yourcompany.com<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Your Company Tagline Here<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<div><div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>From:</b> Helena Marsh &lt;hmarsh@northgatefo.example&gt;<br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Tuesday, November 3, 2026 6:47 PM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Alex Example &lt;alex@yourcompany.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> Follow up - Northgate<o:p></o:p></p></div></div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Alex,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you for the conversation in Scottsdale. We are reviewing a few direct investments in equipment-heavy businesses and would value a call next week to understand how you structure senior debt.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Kind regards,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1F3864\">Helena Marsh</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Director of Investments<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Northgate Family Office<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">4400 N Scottsdale Rd, Suite 900<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Scottsdale, AZ 85251<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">T: 480-555-0115<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">hmarsh@northgatefo.example<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;color:gray\">CONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE: This e-mail message, including any attachments, is for the sole use of the intended recipient(s) and may contain confidential and privileged information. Any unauthorized review, use, disclosure or distribution is prohibited. If you are not the intended recipient, please contact the sender by reply e-mail and destroy all copies of the original message. Northgate Family Office does not accept liability for any errors or omissions in the contents of this message.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
